gps_virtual.c/h: add setVirtualGPSQuality() to set the virtual GPS's satellites, accuracies, and DOPs (the position estimator reads the DOPs)
sitl.c: add the error model in gnss_contested.h to the virtual GPS (on top of betaflight-2026.6.2.patch's noise)
Includes "gnss_contested.h" (copied in by simulation.dockerfile): the same GNSS noise model for PX4, ArduPilot, and Betaflight SITL

diff --git a/src/main/io/gps_virtual.c b/src/main/io/gps_virtual.c
index ef0fd81..1775fb6 100644
